                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #831843; font-size: 1.25rem;">Colección de Esmaltes</h3>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #9d174d; font-weight: 600;">Efecto Gel High Gloss ✨</span>
